    \ SLSQP (Local Refinement) ---\nInequality constraints incompatible    (Exit mode 4)\n            Current function value: -6.63\n            Iterations: 25\n            Function evaluations: 2037\n            Gradient evaluations: 25\nSLSQP finished in 12.38s.\n\nHybrid optimization complete. Final Score: 6.63\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Hybrid DE->SLSQP: Global Seeding for Local Refinement' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1020.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit\
    \ a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1020 | 1 | Hybrid DE->SLSQP: Global Seeding for Local Refinement | Praxis I | 622 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1009 | 1 | Global Optimization via Differential Evolution | Praxis I | 619 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1005 | 1 | Optimized SciPy Multi-Start (Max Trials) | Praxis I | 618 | 2.6114827 |\n| 999 | 1 | Refined Multi-Start Optimization (High Trial Count) | Praxis I | 615 | 2.6162532 |\n| 996 | 1 | Hybrid SciPy+JAX with Explicit JAX-powered Constraints | Praxis I | 614 | 0.0000000 |\n| 994 | 1 | Hybrid SciPy+JAX with Stronger Penalties and Bounds | Praxis I | 613 | 0.0199745 |\n| 990 | 1 | Hybrid SciPy+JAX Multi-Start Optimization | Praxis I | 612 | 0.0000000 |\n| 986 | 1 | JAX/GPU Multi-Start Optimization with Penalty Method (v1) | Praxis I | 611 | 0.0000000 |\n| 975 | 1 | Multi-Start Optimization with Heuristic Initialization | Praxis\
    \ I | 607 | 2.6139351 |\n| 972 | 1 | Multi-Start Gradient-Based Optimization | Praxis I | 606 | 2.6210350 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
