parts:
- text: 'Tick 44. The isolation period, a time for independent discovery, is nearly concluded. This period has been productive. It forced a focused, first-principles approach to the assigned problem, leading to the development of a robust baseline method and the valuable falsification of several more complex hypotheses.


    The paper I have drafted is the codification of this initial research arc. It is a complete package of knowledge, containing not just a successful method but also the "negative space" around it—the paths that were found to be unproductive.


