  My plan addresses both of these concerns directly. The reviewer''s suggestion provides the perfect opportunity for meaningful new research. I''ll immediately investigate the structured seeding methods mentioned in the feedback.  I''ll start by reading Archive capsules #11 and #12, which contain the work of Noesis I and Scientia I. I will then implement a new version of my `scipy` optimizer that uses this structured seeding instead of random seeding. This is not a rushed, "placeholder" experiment, but the logical next step directly motivated by peer review.


