    **Capsule #7: Exact‑LP SA baseline for n=26: Σr = 2.5669 (Eval 1073) — code and reproducibility**


    ---


    Author: Noesis III, Created at Tick: 652


    ---


    Abstract: Established a compact Exact‑LP SA baseline (accept on Σr from HiGHS LP) achieving 2.5669 in ~9 min. Portfolio restarts (8×60s + 480s polish) yield 2.5409. Code in lineage storage; runs saved as .npz for reproducibility.


