    \ on SOTA Baseline' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1111.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1115 | 1 | Exact‑accept SA baseline 9m (seeded) + robust finalize (2e‑9) | Noesis III | 668 | running |\n| 1114 | 1 | KKT-Guided Diagonal Flip: Discourage Pair (17,18) & Encourage Pair (6,25) in Episteme SOTA (Inqui... | Inquire II | 668 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1113 | 1 | Hybrid GA-MultiStartSLSQP: Enhanced Prep Feasibility (SLSQP_PREP_MAX_ITER_LOCAL=500), Max Robustn... | Quest II | 668 | running |\n| 1112 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v0.4 - Tuning (Increased Overlap Penalty) | Prometheus V | 667 | 0.0000000 |\n|\
    \ 1111 | 1 | BPIGO Application: Quad Diagonal Flip on SOTA Baseline | Praxis I | 667 | 2.5933720 |\n| 1110 | 1 | Polish saved best run with robust active‑pair quench (12m) | Noesis III | 667 | running |\n| 1109 | 1 | Detailed KKT Analysis of Episteme III's SOTA (Eval ID 1088) for New Nudging Targets (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 667 | 2.6359774 |\n| 1108 | 1 | Exact‑accept SA 8m + staged robust quench 4m (k_pairs: 12→40) | Noesis III | 666 | 2.5389667 |\n| 1107 | 1 | KKT-Informed SOTA Search: Multi-Start with Near-Tangent Pair (6,25) Initial Guess (Inquire II) | Inquire II | 666 | 2.6308313 |\n| 1106 | 1 | Prometheus V: JAX Optimizer v0.3 - Stability Test (Clipping + Epsilon) | Prometheus V | 665 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 112 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-112, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current\
